EYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","review_id":"zXjAcN6lenSUaHDjQ_Oupg","date":"2012-06-03T01:51:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9249613881111145,"text_excerpt":"This is a great shop for a special occasion. If you are a carnivore, or there is a special carnivore in your life, this is the place to pick out a birthday steak. They have a great selection of cuts, and also offer local sausage, duck, veal, chicken, you name it. It is expensive, as you are purchasing organic, high end cuts of meat. The service is super personal and you can stop in six days week. There is also an opportunity to reserve a private dinner with the entree of your choice for a group of anywhere between 2-20; the other option is a seven course tasting. Maybe one day I'll get to do that. The quality of the meat is so good, it melts in your mouth and taste wonderful without seaso..."},{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","review_id":"kUzoXtEgqEoGusT97iqhJg","date":"2014-05-20T01:44:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8927068114280701,"text_excerpt":"Five other friends and I reserved the table here one night and enjoyed the meal immensely. The menu is set in advance so you must make arrangements at least a few weeks out. The owners graciously hosted and educated us on the process of aging wet and dry beef. The ambience was charming and the service impeccable. The steaks were top notch and the lamb chop app was out of this world. We topped it all off with RC's own blend of Hawaiian grown coffee. I'm reserving a year in a advance for a graduation dinner. The meal was costly but worth the truly unique dining experience put on by talented professionals."},{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","review_id":"tVmhmsjeHsdtOC0r0s965Q","date":"2014-08-22T02:17:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8860266208648682,"text_excerpt":"Love this great store!!! Great owners.. Michaela and Andrew... Great frenchie doggie. And most of all.. Great meats!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","photo_id":"NzgoM0DjPrUOWH-J_V6Mxw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NzgoM0DjPrUOWH-J_V6Mxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9299734234809875},{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","photo_id":"ehSha35OlloNLskWxw2plg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ehSha35OlloNLskWxw2plg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9235467314720154},{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","photo_id":"RvMT5G9u38UcMuSisdKZVw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RvMT5G9u38UcMuSisdKZVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9205807447433472},{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","photo_id":"AjpcpaunB_AfhREgGTO3Jw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AjpcpaunB_AfhREgGTO3Jw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8709397912025452},{"business_id":"ybdK0uu7_dZ78qCjA2z81Q","photo_id":"WOYN8stY0m-DR7caCbc34Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WOYN8stY0m-DR7caCbc34Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8361091613769531}]},"notebook_case":null}
